      "localizations": {
        "et": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Laadi kataloog alla"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Downloading it, and looking once a week for a new edition, fetches files from GitHub. Nothing about you is sent.": {
      "localizations": {
        "et": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Selle allalaadimiseks ja kord nädalas uue väljaande otsimiseks tuuakse failid GitHubist. Sinu kohta ei saadeta midagi."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Downloading the catalogue": {
      "localizations": {
        "et": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kataloog laaditakse alla"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Due back %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "et": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tähtaeg %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ESTER and ELNET": {
      "localizations": {
        "et": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ESTER ja ELNET"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each of these sees your phone's internet address, as any website would. Nothing Loe sends carries an account, cookies or your name, and Loe keeps no record of it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "et": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Igaüks neist näeb sinu telefoni internetiaadressi, nagu iga veebisait. Miski, mida Loe saadab, ei kanna kontot, küpsiseid ega sinu nime, ja Loe ei pea sellest arvet."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Edit": {
      "localizations": {
        "et": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Muuda"
          }
        }
      }
    },
