            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Raamatu lehel olevad lingid avanevad sinu brauseris nagu iga teine link."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Loe follows your phone's language unless you pick one. You can change it in Settings.": {
      "localizations": {
        "et": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Loe kasutab sinu telefoni keelt, kui sa ise teist ei vali. Seda saab muuta seadetes."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Loe found nothing close enough to the books you rated highly. Rate a few more.": {
      "localizations": {
        "et": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Loe ei leidnud midagi piisavalt sarnast raamatutele, mida kõrgelt hindasid. Hinda veel mõnda."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Loe has no ads, no analytics and no tracking.": {
      "localizations": {
        "et": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Loes pole reklaame, analüütikat ega jälgimist."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Loe needs an update": {
      "localizations": {
        "et": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Loe vajab uuendamist"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Loe tries again the next time you open it. Until then, Search finds only books from abroad.": {
      "localizations": {
        "et": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Loe proovib uuesti, kui selle järgmine kord avad. Seni leiab otsing ainult välismaal ilmunud raamatuid."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Loe's catalogue is built from the Estonian National Bibliography (Eesti rahvusbibliograafia) by the National Library of Estonia. Loe keeps the fields it needs and groups editions into works. The National Library publishes it as open data under CC0 1.0. One of its pages gives [CC BY-SA 3.0 EE](https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/ee/) instead, so this credit follows that licence too.": {
      "localizations": {
        "et": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Loe kataloog on tehtud Eesti Rahvusraamatukogu koostatud Eesti rahvusbibliograafiast. Loe jätab alles vajalikud väljad ja koondab väljaanded teosteks. Rahvusraamatukogu avaldab selle avaandmetena CC0 1.0 alusel. Ühel tema lehel on selle asemel [CC BY-SA 3.0 EE](https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/ee/), seepärast järgib see viide ka seda litsentsi."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Loe's code is open under the Mozilla Public License 2.0. The name Loe, its marks and its icon are not part of the licence.": {
      "localizations": {
        "et": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Loe kood on avatud Mozilla Public License 2.0 alusel. Nimi Loe, selle märgid ja ikoon litsentsi alla ei kuulu."
          }
        }
      }
    },
