    "Nothing has been deleted. Your shelves are still on this phone, and in your iCloud when it is on. Try again, or write to us if it keeps happening.": {
      "localizations": {
        "et": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Midagi pole kustutatud. Sinu riiulid on endiselt selles telefonis ja sinu iCloudis, kui see on sisse lülitatud. Proovi uuesti või kirjuta meile, kui see kordub."
          }
