    "The file on GitHub that tells Loe about new catalogue editions can also tell it to stop asking ESTER. It can only make Loe ask less, never more.": {
      "localizations": {
        "et": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "GitHubis olev fail, mis annab Loele teada kataloogi uutest väljaannetest, võib ka öelda, et Loe ESTERilt enam ei küsiks. See saab ainult vähendada seda, mida Loe küsib, mitte kunagi lisada."
          }
